This would be a ridiculous human, but I believe that this is a human being, you know, who made some choices somewhere along the way that got him to be Sandy Rivers.
这会是一个荒谬的人，但我相信这是一个真正的人，你知道的，他在人生某个阶段做出了一些选择，才让他成为了桑迪·里弗斯。

00:53:28.530 --> 00:53:35.969
You know, that's not his real name, you know, but just shout out to Alexis such an incredible performance.
你知道，那不是他的真名，但还是要向亚历克斯致敬，这是如此不可思议的表演。

