你必须细细品味，不能草草带过。

01:04:45.980 --> 01:04:48.340
And we didn't have to, those are the moments.
而我们确实没有草率处理，这些就是核心时刻。

01:04:48.340 --> 01:04:58.130
And those are the moments I think that, that you and Sue and Carter and Craig, like you would, I'm watching, I'm noticing it more now.
而且我觉得正是这些时刻——你、苏（Sue）、卡特（Carter）和克雷格（Craig），你们会……我现在的感触越来越深了。

01:04:58.130 --> 01:05:11.489
Like there's a lot of cut to a reaction of a person, you know, Kobe and me or Ted and Robin, like really having a mask up.
比如有很多切到某个人反应的镜头，你知道的，寇碧和我，或者泰德和罗宾，真的把伪装都卸下了。

01:05:11.489 --> 01:05:17.449
Kobe in particular, I think, is just such a brilliant actor of like playing one thing but feeling another thing.
尤其是寇碧，我觉得她真是一位才华横溢的演员，能把表面一套和内心另一套的感觉演得淋漓尽致。

01:05:17.449 --> 01:05:25.889
like she has a really great ability to like have her social mask up, but let the audience know that there's like something's roiling underneath.
她有一种超能力，既能戴着社交面具，又能让观众察觉到她内心深处有什么东西在翻涌。

01:05:25.889 --> 01:05:29.849
And you guys really honored and preserved those moments in the edit, yeah.
而且你们在剪辑时真的非常尊重并保留了这些时刻，是的。

01:05:29.849 --> 01:05:31.570
Yeah, Sue is really good at that too.
对，苏在这方面也很厉害。

01:05:31.570 --> 01:05:34.050
Sue loved you all, just like Pam loved you all.
苏超级喜欢你们所有人，就像潘喜欢你们所有人一样。

01:05:34.050 --> 01:05:40.250
Like everybody felt like so attuned to your guys' performances, even in a cutaway, even in a no-dialogue cutaway.
就像每个人都对你们的表演心领神会，哪怕只是一个切镜头，哪怕是一个没有台词的切镜头。

01:05:40.250 --> 01:05:43.489
And I think that was a huge part of the success of the show.
我觉得这也是这部剧取得巨大成功的重要原因。

01:05:43.489 --> 01:05:46.329
And Pamela, you made it all happen.
而帕梅拉，这一切都是你促成的。

01:05:46.329 --> 01:06:02.310
I'm glad Sue would come down to the set and spend some time with us because she would tell me like I have such an intimate relationship with you guys, but I don't you don't know me that well Like I'm I'm I'm locked in a room with you guys all day long.
我很高兴苏能来到片场陪我们一会儿，因为她会告诉我，比如我对你们有这么亲密的联系，但我并不——你们其实并不太了解我。就像我——我整天都被关在一个房间里陪着你们。

01:06:02.310 --> 01:06:04.846
I watch you Night, I know how she feels.
我看着你们的夜晚，我知道她的感受。

01:06:04.846 --> 01:06:06.812
It's sure What a pleasure guys.
真是太棒了，伙计们，真荣幸。

01:06:06.812 --> 01:06:07.573
We love you.
我们爱你们。

01:06:07.573 --> 01:06:10.110
Thank you for being here I love you too.
谢谢你们来到这里，我也爱你们。

01:06:10.110 --> 01:06:11.110
I love you so much.
我太爱你们了。

01:06:11.110 --> 01:06:12.110
I love you so much.
我太爱你们了。

01:06:12.110 --> 01:06:13.110
Because of you.
都是因为你们。

01:06:13.110 --> 01:06:21.670
And it can't be overstated how you being the 99.9% director of the show made it what it was.
怎么强调都不为过，作为这部剧 99.9% 的导演，你造就了这部剧今天的模样。

01:06:21.670 --> 01:06:23.429
Thank you so much for being with us today.
非常感谢今天能和我们在一起。

01:06:23.429 --> 01:06:24.429
And always.
一直以来也是。

01:06:24.429 --> 01:06:25.429
Thank you.
谢谢。

01:06:25.429 --> 01:06:27.670
Thanks for making it.
谢谢你们创作了它。

01:06:27.670 --> 01:06:34.849
Pam for I'm and we love you.
帕姆，我们爱你。

01:06:34.849 --> 01:06:37.449
Well that was just delightful.
这真是太美妙了。

01:06:37.449 --> 01:06:41.130
What a treat to have Pam for I'm in any part of your day.
今天能有帕姆加入我们的任何环节，真是一种享受。

01:06:41.130 --> 01:06:43.797
day is better when Pam is a part of that day.
有了帕姆的加入，这一天都会变得更好。

